		// binding NUMBERS (FRHIShaderParameterResource::Index) are proven
		// untrustworthy — the observed failure was the 384-byte
		// MobileDirectionalLight UB delivered at Index 0 landing in
		// @binding(0), which the WGSL names View (6752 bytes): Dawn "buffer
		// bound with size 384 ... requires at least 6752" -> the WHOLE command
		// buffer invalid -> black. In such groups the reflected WGSL NAME is
		// the authority: a uniform-buffer binding whose name matches a static
		// UB binds the STATIC UB (correct identity + exact struct size) even
		// when a pending per-draw entry sits at that slot. Groups that are
		// complete without dummies (the working materials + Slate/HUD) keep
